 Immigrants continue to flow into Long Island.

239
00:23:32,010 --> 00:23:35,390
 Henry Ford starts producing motor cars on an assembly line.

240
00:23:35,390 --> 00:23:47,180
 With the dawning of the 20th century, a dynamic young man named Theodore Roosevelt was to be elected president of the United States.

241
00:23:47,420 --> 00:23:50,900
 Before long, the Wright brothers would fly heavier than aircrafts.

242
00:23:50,900 --> 00:23:56,440
 But this is all contemporary history, and the adventure of space exploration isn't far off.

243
00:23:56,860 --> 00:24:00,720
 Bordered by two great oceans and two countries, Canada and Mexico,

244
00:24:00,940 --> 00:24:03,740
 which would never pose a genuine threat of any kind,

245
00:24:04,130 --> 00:24:10,500
 the United States of America went on developing, growing richer and more powerful throughout its history,

246
00:24:10,640 --> 00:24:13,640
 unlike any European country beset by the tides of fortune.

247
00:24:15,180 --> 00:24:27,230
 At the brink of the 21st century, moving toward the realization of a worldwide community of nations where each for himself has no meaning, this great country must remain as always a beacon for brotherhood.

